 than H2</p> <span class=\"p-card-cta\">View specifications →</span> </a> <a class=\"product-card\" href=\"hah_sleeve_h23.html\"> <svg class=\"p-icon\" viewBox=\"0 0 40 40\" fill=\"none\"><circle cx=\"20\" cy=\"20\" r=\"13\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2.3\"/><circle cx=\"20\" cy=\"20\" r=\"13\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2.3\" stroke-dasharray=\"2,3\"/><rect x=\"17\" y=\"5\" width=\"6\" height=\"7\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.8\"/></svg> <h4>H.AH 23</h4> <p>H2304–H2356 · general-purpose series used with many bearing types</p> <span class=\"p-card-cta\">View specifications →</span> </a> <a class=\"product-card\" href=\"hah_sleeve_h30.html\"> <svg class=\"p-icon\" viewBox=\"0 0 40 40\" fill=\"none\"><circle cx=\"20\" cy=\"20\" r=\"15\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2.3\"/><circle cx=\"20\" cy=\"20\" r=\"15\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2.3\" stroke-dasharray=\"2,3\"/><rect x=\"16\" y=\"3\" width=\"8\" height=\"8\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.8\"/></svg> <h4>H.AH 30</h4> <p>H3024–H30/500 · large-size series</p> <span class=\"p-card-cta\">View specifications →</span> </a> <a class=\"product-card\" href=\"hah_sleeve_h31.html\"> <svg class=\"p-icon\" viewBox=\"0 0 40 40\" fill=\"none\"><circle cx=\"20\" cy=\"20\" r=\"15\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2.3\"/><circle cx=\"20\" cy=\"20\" r=\"15\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2.3\" stroke-dasharray=\"2,3\"/><rect x=\"16\" y=\"3\" width=\"8\" height=\"8\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.8\"/></svg> <h4>H.AH 31</h4> <p>H3122–H31/500 · large-size series</p> <span class=\"p-card-cta\">View specifications →</span> </a> <a class=\"product-card\" href=\"hah_sleeve_h32.html\"> <svg class=\"p-icon\" viewBox=\"0 0 40 40\" fill=\"none\"><circle cx=\"20\" cy=\"20\" r=\"16\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2.3\"/><circle cx=\"20\" cy=\"20\" r=\"16\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2.3\" stroke-dasharray=\"2,3\"/><rect x=\"15\" y=\"2\" width=\"10\" height=\"9\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.8\"/></svg> <h4>H.AH 32</h4> <p>H3260–H32/500 · largest-size series</p> <span class=\"p-card-cta\">View specifications →</span> </a>",
      "※ 계열별 상세 치수와 각주는 각 계열 페이지에서 확인하실 수 있습니다. 정밀 가공·발주 전에는 반드시 당사로 문의해 주세요.": "※ Detailed dimensions and footnotes for each series are available on each series page. Please be sure to contact us before precision machining or ordering.",
      "서울 구로구 경인로53길 32, 미래에코타워 B101·102호": "B101–102, Mirae Eco Tower, 32 Gyeongin-ro 53-gil, Guro-gu, Seoul",
      "<p class=\"eyebrow\">H.AH Adapter Sleeve</p> <h2>H.AH형 어댑터 슬리브</h2> <p> 자동조심 볼 베어링, 자동조심 롤러 베어링, 원통 롤러 베어링 등 다양한 베어링에 맞춰 <strong style=\"color: var(--accent);\">H.AH 2 / H.AH 3 / H.AH 23 / H.AH 30 / H.AH 31 / H.AH 32</strong> 6개 계열로 생산합니다. </p>": "<p class=\"eyebrow\">H.AH Adapter Sleeve</p> <h2>H.AH Adapter Sleeve</h2> <p> Produced in 6 series — <strong style=\"color: var(--accent);\">H.AH 2 / H.AH 3 / H.AH 23 / H.AH 30 / H.AH 31 / H.AH 32</strong> — to match various bearings such as self-aligning ball bearings, self-aligning roller bearings, and cylindrical roller bearings. </p>",
      "스러스트 원통 롤러 베어링": "Thrust Cylindrical Roller Bearings",
      "자동조심 롤러 베어링": "Spherical Roller Bearings",
      "↑ 왼쪽: H형 어댑터 슬리브 (슬리브 + 와셔 + 로크 너트) · 오른쪽: AH형 분리 슬리브 (슬리브 + 분리 너트)<br><span style=\"color: var(--text-faint);\">H형은 가는 쪽 끝에 나사가 있어 너트를 조여 베어링에 고정하고, AH형은 굵은 쪽 끝에 나사가 있어 너트를 조여 베어링에서 빼냅니다.</span>": "↑ Left: H-type adapter sleeve (sleeve + lock washer + lock nut) · Right: AH-type withdrawal sleeve (sleeve + withdrawal nut)<br><span style=\"color: var(--text-faint);\">The H type has its thread at the narrow end, and tightening the nut fixes it in the bearing; the AH type has its thread at the wide end, and tightening the nut pulls it out of the bearing.</span>",
      "<img class=\"fig-wide\" style=\"max-width: 760px;\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/hah_sleeve_plain.webp?v=wm5\" alt=\"H형 어댑터 슬리브(슬리브 + 와셔 + 로크 너트)와 AH형 분리 슬리브(슬리브 + 분리 너트)\"> <p class=\"diagram-legend\">↑ 왼쪽: H형 어댑터 슬리브 (슬리브 + 와셔 + 로크 너트) · 오른쪽: AH형 분리 슬리브 (슬리브 + 분리 너트)<br><span style=\"color: var(--text-faint);\">H형은 가는 쪽 끝에 나사가 있어 너트를 조여 베어링에 고정하고, AH형은 굵은 쪽 끝에 나사가 있어 너트를 조여 베어링에서 빼냅니다.</span></p>": "<img class=\"fig-wide\" style=\"max-width: 760px;\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/hah_sleeve_plain.webp?v=wm5\" alt=\"H-type adapter sleeve (sleeve + lock washer + lock nut) and AH-type withdrawal sleeve (sleeve + withdrawal nut)\"> <p class=\"diagram-legend\">↑ Left: H-type adapter sleeve (sleeve + lock washer + lock nut) · Right: AH-type withdrawal sleeve (sleeve + withdrawal nut)<br><span style=\"color: var(--text-faint);\">The H type has its thread at the narrow end, and tightening the nut fixes it in the bearing; the AH type has its thread at the wide end, and tightening the nut pulls it out of the bearing.</span></p>",
      "어댑터와 사용 베어링 관계 보기 →": "View adapter–bearing combinations →",
      "<a class=\"btn btn-accent btn-sm\" href=\"notice_sn_adapter_zf.html#hah-bearing\">어댑터와 사용 베어링 관계 보기 →</a>": "<a class=\"btn btn-accent btn-sm\" href=\"notice_sn_adapter_zf.html#hah-bearing\">View adapter–bearing combinations →</a>"
    },
